==Battleground==
*2 [[One Horn]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 53.33~56.67 seconds<sup>1,600f~1,700f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Sinner Snache]]s spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 40~46.67 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,400f</sup>.
*1 [[Professor A.]] spawns as the boss after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Ginger Snache]]s spawn after 43.33 seconds<sup>1,300f</sup>, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Bring something that can kill Professor A. The rest of the stage should be minimally threatening.

